# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages: serve the reader for clean chapter paths (200 = rewrite,
# URL stays put). Vercel uses vercel.json; the Northflank image uses serve.json
# (the runtime runs `serve .`, which reads it). Keep all three in step.
# See js/routes.js for the scheme.
#
# /foreword is NOT a reader path — the reader's Chapter 0 panel was retired
# 2026-07, so it serves the standalone page directly.
/foreword   /foreword.html  200
/about      /about.html     200
/chapter-*  /playbook.html  200
